# Technical refresh — 2026-02-14 09:10 UTC

## Purpose and evidence status
- re-check, planning finding, not acceptance/order/commitment; canonical sources unchanged.
- Items now in inbox/workspace:
  - E0 accepted canonical `sources/vendor-capabilities.csv` (historical baseline; accepted).
