## Schedule consequences
No order/delivery/installation records. At 2026-02-14:
- Site A window 5 Jan–27 Feb. V1 6w ordered today delivers 28 Mar; V2 4w delivers 14 Mar; both after window end. Latest order to be ready at window start was 24 Nov (V1) / 8 Dec (V2) 2025. So a new order cannot meet A window; confirm whether already ordered. Recovery/exception operator decision.
