- Overall 30 June completion: C feasible; A/B at risk.

## Conclusion
The last accepted baseline remains A=V1, B=V3, C=V3 (E0), but it is not a current all-sites procurement plan. The 2026-02-14 correction changes the decisive evidence question: if accepted, B has V4 compliant; if not, the 2026-02-10 bulletin/duplicate leaves B with none. Neither candidate is accepted. No order or selection should be made until the exact-digest intake is resolved. Site A schedule is already at risk; Site B is evidence- and schedule-constrained; Site C remains feasible.

